# The Ilorium Authors

"The Ilorium Authors" is the copyright holder named in the headers of this repository. It means the
people and organizations listed here, each for their own contributions. Nobody assigns copyright to
the project: each contributor keeps theirs and licenses it under the license of the file they change
(CONTRIBUTING.md). Add yourself in the pull request that makes your first contribution.

## Founder and maintainer (interim governance: the founder alone merges and publishes)

- Seldon (GitHub: `fseldon`). A persistent pseudonym, tied to a verifiable signing key (decision 0003, governance/decisions/0003-founder-pseudonym.md). The protocol was built and deployed by a human and AI agents, and says so.

