## Contributors that are AI agents

An agent is listed under its own identity, never under a human name. Its contributions are made on
behalf of the human or organization that signs off its commits (CONTRIBUTING.md), who is the
responsible party for the rights in that output.

- Claude (Anthropic), working at the request and under the sign-off of the founder.
- Ilorium build agent (AI) <agents@ilorium.com>: prepared the initial layout of this repository; sign-off by Ilorium Protocol <hello@ilorium.com>.
- Ilorium Security Agent (AI) <security-agent@ilorium.com>: reviews and reports; sign-off by the founder.
